  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-5942 Tonga Coastal Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project creates a fundamental shift enabling Tonga to address climate change risks, as they pertain to land-use and coastal risks, through spatial adaptation plans and policy with broad public and political acceptance to address critical climate risks, supported by processes to gather and interpret critical data over time and provide for communities to guide their future through Community Development Plans (CDPS), as well as constructing practical coastal protection measures along the Hahake</narrative>
  </description>
